      "id": "2a8e0a3d-3161-4779-8b22-14390a7e5d78",
      "name": "Security",
      "description": {
        "content": "The Altruistiq API uses TLS and follows the OAuth 2.0 Client credentials flow as per [RFC 6749](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6749#section-4.4)\n\n### Generating `client_id` and `client_secret`\n\nIn order to generate your `client_id` and `client_secret`, go to the altruistiq application’s organisation settings.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
